# v0.9.1 Phase 8 Task 32 — streaming output envelopes during an eval.
#
# Spec §6.3: streaming output written inside an eval frame carries the
# eval id; the dispatcher emits one "output" envelope per write via the
# per-realm session_writer.  3 sequential writes via the host primitive
# = 3 output envelopes + 1 result + 1 done.
#
# Uses Lobby.__builtin_lobby_send directly; see echo_routes_to_session.chk
# for the rationale (v0.9.1 closure-name-resolution follow-up).

